 "<b style=\"color:#a38217;font-size:30px\">Amarillo</b><br><span style=\"font-size:22px\">Sin riesgo general, pero sí para actividades concretas.</span>": "<b style=\"color:#a38217;font-size:30px\">Yellow</b><br><span style=\"font-size:22px\">No general risk, but there is for specific activities.</span>",
 "<b style=\"color:#b07018;font-size:30px\">Naranja</b><br><span style=\"font-size:22px\">Riesgo meteorológico importante.</span>": "<b style=\"color:#b07018;font-size:30px\">Orange</b><br><span style=\"font-size:22px\">Significant weather risk.</span>",
